# Chaperone's own runtime output. The audit log is a record of a live session:
# it belongs on the machine that produced it, not in version control.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. Bare `decisions.jsonl` matches at
# any depth, which silently excluded examples/decisions.jsonl - the curated
# sample output the README points reviewers at.
/.chaperone/
/decisions.jsonl
/proposals.jsonl

